{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
When you Cast a skill, attack enemies with a wave of spikes that lasts {c_number}{SF_21}{/c} seconds and deals {c_random}{payload:PAYLOAD_PROJECTILE_TOOLTIP}{/c} Physical damage. Enemies take {c_number}[SF_12*100|x%|]{/c} increased damage from {c_important}Wind of Hate{/c} each time it hits them, up to {c_number}[SF_12*SF_13*100|x%|]{/c}.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if}

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Hitting an Elite enemy with a {c_important}Main{/c} Boss Power creates an inert Blister Clone with {c_number}[SF_8*100|%|]{/c} of their Maximum Life for {c_number}{SF_9}{/c} seconds. Killing the Blister removes {c_random}[SF_11*100|2%|]{/c} of the Elite's Life. An Elite can have up to {c_number}{SF_26}{/c} |4Blister:Blisters; active at once, and a Boss can have up to {c_number}{SF_10}{/c} |4Blister:Blisters;. Enemies with Resilience cannot spawn Blisters.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
